cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "arduino-sim-rs: AVR8js-compatible simulator, engine and raylib front-end"
abstract: >-
  A native Rust AVR8 (ATmega328P-class) simulator compatibility port, validated
  against the AVR8js behavioral test suite and against firmware compiled by
  arduino-cli for Arduino UNO boards. The dependency-free simulator engine is the
  `avr8rs` crate, developed in its own repository and consumed here from
  crates.io; this repository holds the headless breadboard host and the raylib
  front-end.
type: software
authors:
